    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Move-only RAII handle for an in-flight distributed transaction.</para>
<para>Destruction: if neither commit() nor abort() was called on the owning coordinator with this handle, the destructor issues an abort so that no transaction is ever silently abandoned.</para>
<para>Construction: only <ref refid="classthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_i_distributed_tx_coordinator_1afdaeef254ee1ba3d0135057ca8122547" kindref="member">IDistributedTxCoordinator::begin()</ref> may construct a valid <ref refid="classthemis_1_1sharding_1_1_tx_handle" kindref="compound">TxHandle</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
